This product is a clean-room rewrite in Python of the ticket core of
Request Tracker (RT), a ticketing system by Best Practical Solutions
(https://github.com/bestpractical/rt), used as the model for what a
ticketing system of this shape does: its screens, the names of its
rights, statuses, menus and fields, the meaning of its tables, and the
protocol of its mail gateway.

Request Tracker is Copyright 1996-2026 Best Practical Solutions, LLC and
is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2. **No part
of Request Tracker is reproduced here**: not its Perl code, its Mason
templates, its stylesheets, scripts or images, its seed data, nor its
documentation. Request Tracker was read as a specification of behaviour
and every line of this repository was written fresh.

py-rt is not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by Best Practical
Solutions, LLC. "Request Tracker", "RT" and "Best Practical" are their
trademarks and are used here only to name the product this one is
modelled on.
